{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to\u00a0<strong><i>Super Serious Golf</i></strong>\u00a0where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Just hit your ball into other players and watch the madness unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/GolfCart.gif?t=1746691808\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test Your Friendships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tired of having too many friends? Battle it out in <strong>8 player lobbies</strong>\u00a0and watch friendships fall apart as you compete through a series of easy-to-learn minigames and game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/GeneralPlay.gif?t=1746691808\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle it out in over <strong>20 unique minigames</strong>\u00a0and show off your style with over <strong>50 unique hats and trails</strong>\u00a0that are all earned through gameplay. None of those pesky microtransactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra Bodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need more players to fill out your lobby?<strong>\u00a0Add bots to any match </strong>to make the chaos even more... chaotic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Private and public lobbies with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of minigames and cosmetics to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game mode selection to change up how minigames are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect interesting powerups to  tip the scales of each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bots to fill out lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514670?t=1746691808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/c07aae07b38dedc352f356908a56c78633cf96c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746691808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/55367d7cf346671b7b41f247552572b18a84f5ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746691808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/55367d7cf346671b7b41f247552572b18a84f5ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746691808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to\u00a0<strong><i>Super Serious Golf</i></strong>\u00a0where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Just hit your ball into other players and watch the madness unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/GolfCart.gif?t=1746691808\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test Your Friendships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tired of having too many friends? Battle it out in <strong>8 player lobbies</strong>\u00a0and watch friendships fall apart as you compete through a series of easy-to-learn minigames and game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/GeneralPlay.gif?t=1746691808\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle it out in over <strong>20 unique minigames</strong>\u00a0and show off your style with over <strong>50 unique hats and trails</strong>\u00a0that are all earned through gameplay. None of those pesky microtransactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Extra Bodies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need more players to fill out your lobby?<strong>\u00a0Add bots to any match </strong>to make the chaos even more... chaotic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Private and public lobbies with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of minigames and cosmetics to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game mode selection to change up how minigames are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect interesting powerups to  tip the scales of each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bots to fill out lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2>","developers":["Karnage Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/7da6f8c2e5dea7ccbf3c8adbcf247a1ce787fcdb/header.jpg?t=1746691808","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122066,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122066/movie480.mp4?t=1746366161","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122066/movie_max.mp4?t=1746366161"},"name":"Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122066/855a84c9961c0cc40db8e50b65214e60343da2dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746366161","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122066/movi